{% comment %}
  The TAIYIB house page, served as the storefront home page.

  A Liquid template rather than JSON, because only a Liquid template can select
  a layout — and this page needs layout/taiyib.liquid rather than
  layout/theme.liquid, which would add Horizon's header-group and footer-group
  on top of the masthead and colophon the design already carries.

  Every section below is a real section, so all copy, prices, specs and images
  stay editable in the theme editor.

  The previous home page was the stock Horizon hero and product list; it is in
  git history at templates/index.json if it is ever wanted back.
{% endcomment %}
